# The shell hands over every pair out of 43 values, and each value with itself: undefined, null, the booleans, both zeros, 1 as an int32 and as a double, three NaNs, texts that are atoms, ropes, pieces of
# longer texts, 16-bit copies and too long for a stub, BigInts in one cell and in two, symbols, objects. Each value is made anew for each question, so that a rope arrives as a rope.
# The shell asks itself the same question behind each answer.
